@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title 2NDHAND - submission architecture target
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
left to right direction
actor "Android user" as User
component "Standalone Expo Android APK" as App
component "Google / Auth provider" as Auth
component "FastAPI complete app" as API
database "PostgreSQL\nOrders / inspections / settlements / reviews" as DB
component "Private Storage\nIdentity / inspection / legacy delivery evidence" as Storage
component "Scheduled server worker\nSame guarded services" as Worker
actor "Public QR visitor" as Visitor
component "Public certificate HTML / JSON\nHTTPS opaque token / no PII" as Public
component "Simulated payment / transport / payout" as Sim

User --> App
App --> Auth : provider login
App --> API : HTTPS / verified bearer
API --> Auth : verified identity
API --> DB : locks / transactions / migrations
API --> Storage : authorized private objects
API --> Sim : persisted simulations
Worker --> DB : bounded scans / locks
Worker --> Storage : guarded proof checks
Visitor --> Public : no login
Public --> API : minimal public projection
note bottom of Worker
  No HTTP traffic required.
  Six jobs: unpaid, receipt, no-ship, return retry, inspection escalation, result timeout.
  EXTERNAL_V2 transport events differ from actual recipient receipt.
end note
note bottom of App
  Latest UI preserved; no catalog-only or buyer-only release.
  API/QR origins reachable from actual phone, not localhost.
end note
@enduml
